      "id": "pf_4693b73d_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Our Co-Founder, Manju has had her footprints in the skincare and haircare journey for long now. Manju takes it as a gospel that everything we need to keep our skin and hair looking their best and healthy, we can find in our kitchens. This belief was the seed to creating Sonnet Wellness which started off as a home based venture.<br><br>Postpartum, Manju created hair care concoctions for herself at home. After great results, her family and friends also grew keen on trying these mixes for themselves and began requesting for orders, leading to Manju’s introduction into the hair care industry.<br><br>A huge segment of the mixtures she created consisted of curd. After researching a little more, Manju realised that what made her blends so effective was the probiotic component of curd. Manju didn’t want to keep her powerful blends only to her friends and soon developed into the creation of Sonnet Wellness officially.While she wanted the line to be efficient and effective, she didn’t want it to be a product of animal testing or cruelty of any kind. This was why she decided to use lab made probiotic which made it not only cruelty free but also vegan."
