      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Safety Tests, Clinically &amp; FDA Approved: We send our products for safety tests and dermatological tests. Our products and ingredients are clinically tested, clinically cleared and approved by the FDA. Only once we are happy with what we’ve produced and know that it is safe to use, is when we launch it into the market. "
    },
