    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_98e71fbc_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "We are transparent about every ingredient that goes into the making of our product. Whether it’s a key ingredient or a supporting ingredient that contributes - even if it is at a lesser quantity. Also, contrary to popular belief, chemical compounds do appear in the most naturally available ingredients as well. We make it a point to also mention the chemicals that are available in any of our naturally sourced, organic ingredients so you know exactly what you are using on your skin and body."
    },
