    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_bc975083_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Yes to Good Ingredients. No to Harmful Chemicals: Our ingredients and products contain no toxic parabens, GMO, pthalates, alcohol, mineral oil, petrolatum, Propylene Glycol. We only use the best of the ingredients and formulation and produce them in the safest way possible. "
    },
