      "id": "pf_dbc757a4_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Sonnet Wellness is a new age wellness brand that is constantly working towards bringing the best of products to cater to your overall health. We leverage the latest wellness technology and craftsmanship to create products so you get only the best of concoctions that increase your overall wellbeing. Safe to use and result oriented, our products do not contain harsh chemicals. They hit the sweet spot between organic and clinical ingredients giving you actual results every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_e5765a7a_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Our vision at Sonnet Wellness is to create safe to use, accessible, clinically tested and approved, highly effective, result oriented, skincare &amp; wellness products that contain no harsh chemicals.<br><br>Build a community around people who are passionate about wellness and personal care and provide product guidance and skincare consultation support to our consumers.Create total transparency around our products and its ingredients. No Lies. No B.S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_ff8b6be3_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Highly Efficient, Result Oriented: Our mission is to bring to you solutions that give you the maximum benefit and are highly effective while being safe to use and contain no harsh chemicals.  We use active ingredients that are most beneficial and effective at potent concentrations. We don’t believe in discriminating against natural or safe synthetic ingredients and instead look for ingredients that are efficient and functional and give you the best results. We pick ingredients based on their compatibility with each other to ensure there are no side effects when they are used together. Our objective is simple - to get you the most effective, result based products."
